      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Bones.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 5, power rating 8 → a level 5 Rogue player-character sheet (a player may take this seat; the authored CR 4 stands in where the ledger is silent). Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Infiltrator Who Triggered the Massacre &amp; Master of the Planar Sanctum Discovery</strong> — Liberated Toads / Disaster Inc. (Independent Infiltrator)</p><p>Status: Active — resting at an Alpine Mountain Inn near Mighdural/Regal Capital after escaping the Planar Sanctum, meeting the Toad God, and discovering Thornbury's betrayal</p><p>Bones is a master infiltrator who survived Aegis Command, Order 120, and custody in the Corvinarus Planar Sanctum. After awakening alone in the Fractured Sanctum, Bones stole Fundamentals of Abjuration, uncovered Corvinarus's 10-page masterwork Veins of the Tapestry, refused the Oracle's flesh vat, engaged a fiendish Canoloth, was saved by the Toad God at the Astral Altar, and was teleported to the Regal Capital. There, at Alpine Bank, Bones eavesdropped on Thornbury placing a bounty on Archie Miser over a broken rope and claiming Legion credentials. Bones fled into a severe snowstorm and paid 3 Midland Ducats for shelter at an Alpine Inn.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Infiltrator's Knife</strong> — “Bones is a master infiltrator who survived Aegis Command, Order 120, and custody in the Corvinarus Planar Sanctum.”</li><li><strong>Borrowed Guard Spear</strong> — “At Aegis Command he used a guard disguise to enter the fortress and look for Speaker L. The prisoner was a decoy.”</li><li><strong>Sneak Attack</strong> — “Bones is a master infiltrator who survived Aegis Command, Order 120, and custody in the Corvinarus Planar Sanctum.”</li><li><strong>Master of Disguise</strong> — “Unknown (skilled at disguise, so identification is uncertain)”</li><li><strong>Keeps Going Back</strong> — “Bones is a master infiltrator who survived Aegis Command, Order 120, and custody in the Corvinarus Planar Sanctum.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/bones</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/bones</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
